、无衬线印刷体、笔画完整）；激光束精准命中“Flux2”标识附近，爆炸瞬间定格：冲击波环形扩散、火花四溅、金属碎片飞散、外壳熔融裂缝与高亮能量喷溅、烟尘体积光，但无血腥。\nzimage 字样必须明显且可读：刘德华脸部闪电符文纹身中嵌入清晰印刷体“zimage”（高对比度发光文字）；胸甲中央与肩甲各一处发光贴花/铭牌同样印着“zimage”（明显、可读、非乱码）。\n暴风雨夜空背景，闪电照亮人物与 UFO，雨滴飞溅，主体清晰对焦在人物脸部“zimage”和 UFO 的“Flux2”铭牌，浅景深，动态模糊仅用于碎片与雨丝，超高细节、真实皮肤质感、IMAX 电影海报质感、8K。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [607.5438842773438, 464.5615234375], "pos": [-150.141845703125, 224.95504760742188], "id": 13, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-1424.5103071257506, 8.788958279234578], "scale": 0.8769226950000054}}, "groups": [{"color": "#8AA", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "输入参数", "bounding": [-170.0459442138672, 134.70828247070312, 658.85986328125, 787.017822265625]}, {"color": "#88A", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "模型加载", "bounding": [758.0889892578125, -389.12994384765625, 593.1437377929688, 528.641357421875]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "输出结果", "bounding": [2145.828125, -64.6880874633789, 838.6932983398438, 935.4915771484375]}], "links": [[10, 14, 0, 8, 0, "LATENT"], [11, 11, 0, 8, 1, "VAE"], [12, 8, 0, 9, 0, "IMAGE"], [13, 12, 0, 14, 0, "MODEL"], [14, 18, 0, 14, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [15, 19, 0, 14, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [16, 15, 0, 14, 3, "LATENT"], [17, 16, 0, 15, 0, "INT"], [18, 17, 0, 15, 1, "INT"], [19, 10, 0, 18, 0, "CLIP"], [20, 13, 0, 18, 1, "STRING"], [21, 18, 0, 19, 0, "CONDITIONING"]], "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 19, "revision": 0}